🎮 Games
https://lsong.org/games

Controls
--------
Drag the joystick to move in eight directions; return to the center or lift
your finger to stop. Hold A and B with other fingers while moving. In landscape
on phones, the joystick sits to the left of the screen and A/B to the right.

Keyboard: WASD or arrow keys to move, L for A, K for B, Enter for Start,
and either Shift key for Select.

Development
-----------
Serve this directory with any static HTTP server, for example:
  python3 -m http.server 8000

Browser regression tests (Node.js 20 or later):
  npm ci
  npx playwright install chromium webkit
  npm test

The tests start their own local server and cover joystick dragging, multi-touch,
input cleanup, keyboard combinations, responsive layouts, and real-game boot.
